local AAd,BAd=pcall(bb.liveDps,xAd,zAd)
uAd[zAd]=uAd[zAd]or{}
table.insert(uAd[zAd],{m=xAd,lvl=yAd.upgrade.Value,max=yAd.max_upgrade.Value,dps=AAd and BAd or 0})
end
end
local CAd={}
for DAd,EAd in ipairs(bb.team or{})do
if EAd.hand then
CAd[EAd.id]=true
end
end
local FAd={}
for GAd,HAd in pairs(uAd)do
table.sort(HAd,function(IAd,JAd)
if IAd.dps~=JAd.dps then
return IAd.dps>JAd.dps
end
return IAd.lvl>JAd.lvl
end)
table.insert(FAd,{id=GAd,dps=HAd[1].dps*bb.airBoost(HAd[1].m)*bb.reach(HAd[1].m)})
end
table.sort(FAd,function(KAd,LAd)
return KAd.dps>LAd.dps
end)
for MAd=1,math.min(3,#FAd)do
bb.mergeIds[FAd[MAd].id]=true
end
local NAd
for OAd,PAd in pairs(uAd)do
local QAd=table.clone(PAd)
table.sort(QAd,function(RAd,SAd)
if RAd.lvl~=SAd.lvl then
return RAd.lvl<SAd.lvl
end
return RAd.dps<SAd.dps
end)
for TAd,UAd in ipairs(QAd)do
if UAd.m==bb.freshM and TAd>1 then
table.remove(QAd,TAd)
table.insert(QAd,1,UAd)
break
end
end
local VAd,WAd,XAd,YAd
for ZAd,_Ad in ipairs(QAd)do
local aBd,bBd=U.flat(_Ad.m:GetPivot().Position),_Ad.m._stats.range.Value
local cBd,dBd,eBd=0,0,nil
for fBd,gBd in ipairs(PAd)do
if gBd~=_Ad and(U.flat(gBd.m:GetPivot().Position)-aBd).Magnitude<=bBd then
cBd,dBd=cBd+gBd.dps,dBd+1
if not eBd or gBd.dps>eBd.dps then
eBd=gBd
end
end
end
if dBd>0 then
VAd,WAd,XAd,YAd=_Ad,cBd,dBd,eBd
break
end
end
YAd=YAd or PAd[1]
local hBd=YAd.dps*bb.airBoost(YAd.m)*bb.reach(YAd.m)*(OAd==bb.planId and 2 or 1)
if(bb.mergeIds[OAd]or OAd==bb.planId)and(VAd or CAd[OAd])and(not NAd or hBd>NAd.score)then
NAd={id=OAd,top=YAd,fresh=VAd,near=WAd or 0,n=XAd or 0,coming=CAd[OAd],score=hBd}
end
end
bb.planId,bb.freshM=NAd and NAd.id,NAd and NAd.fresh and NAd.fresh.m
bb.mergeHeldAt=(rAd and NAd and NAd.fresh)and(bb.mergeHeldAt or bb.wave())or nil
if not NAd then
return F.status(cHe[4913],cHe[5011])
end
local iBd,jBd=bb.wave(),(bb.total or 30)-bb.wave()
local kBd=(bb.pressure or 0)>=math.min(O.dangerReach,((bb.depth and bb.depth.units>0 and bb.depth.covEnd)or 1)*0.9)
local lBd=NAd.fresh
local mBd=not kBd and jBd>3
NAd.waits=lBd and lBd.lvl<=NAd.top.lvl and NAd.top.lvl<NAd.top.max and mBd or false
local nBd=(not lBd or lBd.lvl>=NAd.top.lvl)and NAd.coming and mBd
local oBd=bb.cloneCard and NAd.top.lvl>=NAd.top.max and mBd
local pBd=lBd and lBd.lvl>NAd.top.lvl and NAd.near<0.3*lBd.dps
NAd.ready=rAd and lBd~=nil and not pBd and(not(NAd.waits or nBd or oBd)or iBd-(bb.mergeHeldAt or iBd)>=5)
bb.holdNoCardAt=(NAd.waits and not rAd)and(bb.holdNoCardAt or iBd)or nil
NAd.hold=NAd.waits and(rAd or iBd-(bb.holdNoCardAt or iBd)<4)
bb.mergePlan=NAd
F.status(cHe[4913],lBd and string.format(cHe[5012],V.name(NAd.id),NAd.n,NAd.n==1 and cHe[5013]or cHe[5014],lBd.lvl,NAd.ready and cHe[5015]or(rAd and cHe[5016]or cHe[5017]))or string.format(cHe[5018],V.name(NAd.id)))
end
function bb.mergeHold(qBd)
local rBd=bb.mergePlan
return rBd and rBd.hold and rBd.fresh and rBd.fresh.m==qBd or false
end
function bb.mergeBoost(sBd)
local tBd=bb.mergePlan
if not(tBd and tBd.top.m==sBd and(tBd.fresh or tBd.coming))then
return 1
end
return bb.mergeHeldAt and 2 or 1.3
end
function bb.mergeSpot(uBd)
if not(bb.random and bb.mergeIds[uBd.id])then
return nil
end
local vBd,wBd
for xBd,yBd in ipairs(bb.mine or{})do
if yBd._stats.id.Value==uBd.id then
local zBd,ABd=pcall(bb.liveDps,yBd,uBd.id)
ABd=zBd and ABd or 0
if not wBd or ABd>wBd then
vBd,wBd=yBd,ABd
end
end
end
return vBd and vBd:GetPivot().Position
end
function bb.mergeMeasure(BBd)
local CBd=bb.mergeBefore
if not CBd then
return
end
task.delay(2,function()
if not(BBd and BBd.Parent)then
return
end
local DBd,EBd=pcall(bb.liveDps,BBd,BBd._stats.id.Value)
if not DBd then
return
end
local FBd=CBd.own+1.5*CBd.near
local GBd=P.fh.merge or{n=0,ratio=0}
if FBd>0 then
GBd.n,GBd.ratio=GBd.n+1,GBd.ratio+EBd/FBd
end
P.fh.merge=GBd
local HBd=BBd._stats.id.Value
P.fh.noMerge=P.fh.noMerge or{}
local IBd,JBd=EBd-CBd.own,1.5*CBd.near
if JBd>0 and IBd<0.1*JBd then
P.fh.noMerge[HBd]=(P.fh.noMerge[HBd]or 0)+1
elseif JBd>0 and IBd>=0.5*JBd then
P.fh.noMerge[HBd]=nil
end
F.log(1,cHe[4934],string.format(cHe[5019],V.name(BBd._stats.id.Value),U.fmt(CBd.own),U.fmt(EBd),CBd.lvl,U.fmt(CBd.near),U.fmt(FBd),CBd.top))
end)
end
function bb.farmMergeOk()
local KBd=P.fh.farmMerge
if not(KBd and KBd.n>0)then
return true
end
return KBd.ratio/KBd.n>=0.8
end
function bb.farmMergePair()
local LBd={}
for MBd,NBd in ipairs(bb.mine or{})do
local OBd=NBd._stats.id.Value
if V.isFarm(OBd)and NBd._stats:FindFirstChild(cHe[2340])then
LBd[OBd]=LBd[OBd]or{}
table.insert(LBd[OBd],NBd)
end
end
for PBd,QBd in pairs(LBd)do
if#QBd>=2 then
table.sort(QBd,function(RBd,SBd)
return RBd._stats.upgrade.Value<SBd._stats.upgrade.Value
end)
for TBd,UBd in ipairs(QBd)do
local VBd,WBd=U.flat(UBd:GetPivot().Position),UBd._stats.range.Value
local XBd,YBd=0,0
for ZBd,_Bd in ipairs(QBd)do
if _Bd~=UBd and(U.flat(_Bd:GetPivot().Position)-VBd).Magnitude<=WBd then
XBd,YBd=XBd+(tonumber(_Bd._stats.farm_amount.Value)or 0),YBd+1
end
end
if YBd>0 then
return UBd,XBd,YBd
end
end
end
end
end
function bb.farmMergeSpot(aCd)
if not(bb.random and bb.farmMergeOk())then
return nil
end
for bCd,cCd in ipairs(bb.mine or{})do
if cCd._stats.id.Value==aCd.id then
return cCd:GetPivot().Position,tonumber(cCd._stats.range.Value)or 0
end
end
end
function bb.farmMergeMeasure(dCd)
local eCd=bb.farmMergeBefore
if not eCd then
return
end
task.delay(2,function()
if not(dCd and dCd.Parent)then
return
end
local fCd=tonumber(dCd._stats.farm_amount.Value)or 0
local gCd=eCd.own+1.5*eCd.inc
local hCd=P.fh.farmMerge or{n=0,ratio=0}
hCd.n,hCd.ratio=hCd.n+1,hCd.ratio+(gCd>0 and fCd/gCd or 0)
P.fh.farmMerge=hCd
F.log(1,cHe[4934],string.format(cHe[5020],V.name(dCd._stats.id.Value),U.fmt(fCd),U.fmt(eCd.own),U.fmt(eCd.inc),U.fmt(gCd)))
end)
end
bb.IDOL_PRIOR={dmg=0.05,cost=0.05}
function bb.idolStep()
local iCd=P.fh.idol
local jCd,kCd=bb.IDOL_PRIOR.dmg,bb.IDOL_PRIOR.cost
if iCd and iCd.n>0 then
jCd,kCd=iCd.dmg/iCd.n,iCd.cost/iCd.n
end
return math.max(0,jCd)+math.max(0,kCd)*0.5
end
function bb.idolMeasure()
local lCd
for mCd,nCd in ipairs(bb.mine)do
local oCd=nCd._stats.id.Value
local pCd=nCd._stats:FindFirstChild(cHe[2665])
if not V.isFarm(oCd)and not V.idol(oCd)and pCd and pCd.Value>0 then
lCd=nCd
break
end
end
if not lCd then
return
end
local qCd=lCd._stats
local function rCd()
local sCd,tCd=pcall(N.USC.calculate_upgrade_cost_multiplier,lCd,N.session())
local uCd=qCd:FindFirstChild(cHe[4759])and tonumber(qCd.buff_damage_multiplier.Value)or 0
return qCd.damage.Value*(1+uCd),sCd and tonumber(tCd)or nil
end
local vCd,wCd=rCd()
local xCd=qCd.upgrade.Value
task.delay(3,function()
if not lCd.Parent or qCd.upgrade.Value~=xCd then
return
end
local yCd,zCd=rCd()
if not(wCd and zCd and wCd>0 and vCd>0)then
return
end
if yCd==vCd and zCd==wCd then
return F.log(2,cHe[4725],cHe[5021])
end
local ACd=P.fh.idol or{n=0,dmg=0,cost=0}
ACd.n,ACd.dmg,ACd.cost=ACd.n+1,ACd.dmg+(yCd/vCd-1),ACd.cost+(1-zCd/wCd)
P.fh.idol=ACd
F.log(1,cHe[4725],string.format(cHe[5022],V.name(qCd.id.Value),(yCd/vCd-1)*100,(1-zCd/wCd)*100))
end)
end
function bb.spells()
local BCd=N.session()
local CCd=BCd and BCd.ingame_spells
if type(CCd)~=cHe[2220]or bb.spellBusy then
return
end
local DCd=bb.money()
local ECd=(bb.pressure or 0)>=math.min(O.dangerReach,((bb.depth and bb.depth.units>0 and bb.depth.covEnd)or 1)*0.9)
local FCd,GCd,HCd
for ICd,JCd in ipairs(bb.mine)do
local KCd=JCd._stats.id.Value
if not V.isFarm(KCd)and not V.allyBuff(KCd)and KCd~=cHe[4452]then
local LCd,MCd=pcall(bb.liveDps,JCd,KCd)
local NCd=LCd and MCd and MCd*bb.airBoost(JCd)*bb.reach(JCd)
if NCd and(not HCd or NCd>HCd)then
FCd,GCd,HCd=JCd,MCd,NCd
end
end
end
local OCd=bb.mergePlan
local PCd={}
for QCd,RCd in pairs(CCd)do
table.insert(PCd,{slot=QCd,spell=RCd,rank=bb.SPELL_ORDER[RCd]or 9})
end
table.sort(PCd,function(SCd,TCd)
return SCd.rank<TCd.rank
end)
bb.spellWant=nil
bb.cloneNote=nil
for UCd,VCd in ipairs(PCd)do
local WCd,XCd=VCd.slot,VCd.spell
local YCd,ZCd
local _Cd
for aDd,bDd in ipairs(bb.mine)do
if bDd._stats.id.Value==cHe[4452]then
_Cd=bDd
end
end
local cDd=_Cd and(bb.buffCount[_Cd]or 0)<2
if XCd==cHe[5023]and DCd>=1000 and(cDd or FCd)then
if cDd then
YCd,ZCd=_Cd,cHe[5024]
else
YCd,ZCd=FCd,cHe[5025]
end
elseif XCd==cHe[4946]and OCd and OCd.ready then
if DCd>=1000 then
YCd,ZCd=OCd.fresh.m,string.format(cHe[5026],OCd.n,OCd.n==1 and cHe[5013]or cHe[5014])
bb.mergeBefore={own=OCd.fresh.dps,near=OCd.near,lvl=OCd.fresh.lvl,top=OCd.top.lvl}
else
bb.spellWant=bb.spellWant or{cost=1000,why=cHe[5027]..V.name(OCd.id)}
end
elseif XCd==cHe[4946]and DCd>=1000 and not ECd and not(OCd and OCd.fresh)and bb.farmMergeOk()and bb.farmMergePair()then
local dDd,eDd,fDd=bb.farmMergePair()
YCd=dDd
ZCd=string.format(cHe[5028],fDd,V.name(dDd._stats.id.Value))
bb.farmMergeBefore={own=tonumber(dDd._stats.farm_amount.Value)or 0,inc=eDd}
elseif XCd==cHe[5010]then
local gDd=not ECd and OCd and OCd.fresh and OCd.top.lvl<OCd.top.max
bb.cloneWaitAt=gDd and(bb.cloneWaitAt or bb.wave())or nil
local hDd=gDd and bb.wave()-bb.cloneWaitAt<5
local iDd,jDd
if not ECd and OCd and OCd.fresh and OCd.top.lvl>=OCd.top.max then
iDd,jDd=OCd.top.m,cHe[5029]
elseif not hDd and FCd then
iDd,jDd=FCd,ECd and cHe[5030]or cHe[5031]
end
if hDd then
bb.cloneNote=string.format(cHe[5032],V.name(OCd.id),OCd.top.lvl,OCd.top.max,5-(bb.wave()-bb.cloneWaitAt))
end
if iDd and DCd>=5000 then
YCd,ZCd=iDd,jDd
elseif iDd then
local kDd,lDd=pcall(bb.liveDps,iDd,iDd._stats.id.Value)
lDd=kDd and tonumber(lDd)or 0
if lDd>=(bb.bestRate or 0)*5000*0.5 then
bb.spellWant=bb.spellWant or{cost=5000,why=cHe[5033]..V.name(iDd._stats.id.Value),rate=lDd/5000}
bb.cloneNote=cHe[5034]..V.name(iDd._stats.id.Value)
else
bb.cloneNote=string.format(cHe[5035],V.name(iDd._stats.id.Value),U.fmt(lDd),U.fmt((bb.bestRate or 0)*5000))
